    "zoneShare": 0.15,
    "_speedNote": "FIXPHYS v99: speedMps > 0 = the blow is a velocity change of the whole body (impulse = speed x total mass, every body gets the same, the struck zone part gets zoneShare extra); impulse/lift above are only used when speedMps is 0. 70 N s on Pitborn (120 kg) was 0.58 m/s and the knee collapse beat it.",
